<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CRICKET-SUPERSPORT SERIES SCORES.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SUPERSPORT SERIES SCORES.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-02-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scores in the Supersport Series matches played on Saturday:</p>
<p>In Kimberley (day two): Northern Transvaal 363 (Andre Seymore 132, Martin van Jaarsveld 109, Garth Roe 4-74), Griqualand West 203-2 (Martyn Gidley 61 not out, Pieter Barnard 80 not out).</p>
<p>In Johannesburg (day one): Transvaal 326-7 (Neil McKenzie 139, Stefan Jacobs 72 not out) against Western Province.</p>
</text>
